### Email Verification Fix Test
### Test the fixed email verification flow

### 1. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "TestPass123!",
  "firstname": "Test",
  "lastname": "User"
}

### 2. Check if user was created (should return success even if email sending fails)
### The response should show the user was registered successfully

### 3. Try to resend verification email
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com"
}

### 4. Try to verify with a dummy OTP (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 5. Try to register with same email again (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "username": "anotheruser",
  "password": "TestPass123!",
  "firstname": "Another",
  "lastname": "User"
}

### 6. Try to login (should work even without email verification)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}
